<section class="section"><div class="container"><h2>Community Documents</h2><h3>Our shared foundations</h3>
<p>Discover the documents that articulate the DSG Community's vision, strategic priorities, and collective ambitions.</p>
<div class="card-grid"><article class="card"><h3>DSG Manifesto</h3>
<p><em>Manifesto of the Data Stewardship in Germany Community – A Strategic Vision for the Future of Research Data Stewardship</em></p>
<p>Our manifesto sets out a shared vision for strengthening the recognition, professionalisation, and strategic integration of data stewardship in Germany.</p>
<p>See the <a href="/about/">About page</a> for an introduction to our shared vision and priorities.</p>
</article></div></div></section>
<section class="section section-soft"><div class="container"><h2>DSgG on Zenodo</h2><h3>Our Community Collection</h3>
<p>Explore publications, presentations, posters, reports, and other research outputs contributed by the Data Stewardship goes Germany community.</p>
<p>Our Zenodo collection provides a shared space to discover and preserve community contributions, making them accessible, citable, and reusable.</p>
<a class="button" href="https://zenodo.org/communities/dsgg/records">Explore the DSgG Zenodo Community</a>
</div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container"><h2>Networks and Initiatives</h2><h3>Connecting with the wider landscape</h3>
<p>Data stewardship develops through collaboration across institutions, disciplines, and national borders. This section highlights networks and initiatives that contribute to professional exchange, shared practices, and the advancement of research data stewardship.</p>
</div></section>
<section class="section section-soft"><div class="container"><h2>Practical Resources and Learning</h2><h3>Supporting professional development</h3>
<p>We aim to highlight selected frameworks, training opportunities, guidance, and practical materials relevant to data stewards, rather than provide a comprehensive catalogue of research data management tools.</p>
</div></section>
